flowchart LR
  F[Approved ordinary funding] --> T0[T0 Genesis]
  T0 --> U0[Output 0: P / vault B0]
  T0 -. commits .-> C0[Trailing caboose: GENESIS / no id]
  U0 -->|spend| T1[T1 First transition]
  T1 --> U1[Output 0: P / vault B1]
  T1 -. commits .-> C1[Trailing caboose: ACTIVE / id = txid T0]
  U1 -->|spend| T2[T2 Continuation]
  T2 --> U2[Output 0: P / vault B2]
  T2 -. commits .-> C2[Trailing caboose: ACTIVE / preserve id]
